msgid "Computed by decisions/isolation-gate.dmn (hit policy FIRST) over three inputs: its own declaration with paths relative to itself, its own namespace with every minted term defined, and a published artefact of its own. Any one missing answers `not yet`, back to Isolate. All three answer `isolated`, on to reporting what would move and waiting for a person to authorise it. Zero edges alone is not isolation."
